NNAAMMEE
     iissccii — Intel C600 Serial Attached SCSI driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into your kernel, place the following lines in
     your kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee ssccbbuuss
           ddeevviiccee iissccii

     Or, to load the driver as a module at boot, place the following line in
     loader.conf(5):

           isci_load="YES"

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The iissccii driver provides support for Intel C600 SAS controllers.

CCOONNFFIIGGUURRAATTIIOONN
     To force legacy interrupts for all iissccii driver instances, set the follow‐
     ing tunable value in loader.conf(5):

           hw.isci.force_legacy_interrupts=1

DDEEBBUUGGGGIINNGG
     To enable debugging prints from the iissccii driver, set the

           hw.isci.debug_level

     variable to a value between 1 and 4 in loader.conf(5).

     The hardware layer in the iissccii driver has extensive logging capabilities
     which are disabled by default for performance reasons.  These can be en‐
     abled by adding

           options ISCI_LOGGING

     to the kernel configuration file.

